# Configuration for the MaxClients tests: a global limit of two clients,
# two listeners, and an uplink which does not count against the limit.

ServerId   TESTING
PassCode   31421
MyEmail    email@example.com
MyAdmin    "Admin, N0CALL"

RunDir data

UpstreamTimeout		10s
ClientTimeout		48h

Listen "Full feed"             fullfeed    tcp 0.0.0.0  55152
Listen "Igate port"            igate       tcp 0.0.0.0  55580

Uplink full1 full tcp 127.0.0.1 10153

MaxClients 2

WorkerThreads 3
FileLimit        10000
